WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.680
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.950 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.750
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.750 --> 01:45.880
[Episode 17]

5
01:46.920 --> 01:47.680
I guess

6
01:48.200 --> 01:50.150
Xuanyuan Shan will eventually find out

7
01:50.150 --> 01:51.479
that it was me who told

8
01:51.479 --> 01:52.560
the Crown Prince about the government salt.

9
01:52.560 --> 01:53.350
I bet

10
01:54.120 --> 01:56.350
she'll probably come looking for trouble.

11
01:56.350 --> 01:58.590
Who does Xuanyuan Shan think she is?

12
02:00.480 --> 02:01.940
No need to wait any longer.

13
02:04.560 --> 02:06.950
Let's settle the score right now.

14
02:08.560 --> 02:09.590
Chief Xuanyuan.

15
02:10.960 --> 02:12.000
Chief Xuanyuan.

16
02:13.590 --> 02:15.630
I was just talking nonsense.

17
02:16.000 --> 02:18.030
Please don't take it to heart.

18
02:22.520 --> 02:24.050
Thank you, Chief Xuanyuan.

19
02:24.590 --> 02:26.360
I'll take my leave now.

20
02:27.470 --> 02:28.280
Li Qingyang,

21
02:28.750 --> 02:30.150
I can't protect you.

22
02:30.520 --> 02:31.630
You're on your own.

23
02:41.710 --> 02:44.079
The Mingling case involves the royal family.

24
02:44.079 --> 02:45.560
It should have been investigated thoroughly

25
02:45.560 --> 02:47.120
before it was submitted to His Majesty.

26
02:47.120 --> 02:47.960
Li Qingyang,

27
02:48.400 --> 02:50.310
you actually handed over the case evidence

28
02:50.310 --> 02:51.910
to the Crown Prince privately.

29
02:51.910 --> 02:54.440
Do you know what a huge trouble you've caused?

30
02:55.960 --> 02:59.190
If a prince breaks the law, he gets the same penalty as the commoners.

31
02:59.190 --> 03:01.910
The evidence of the Mingling case is conclusive.

32
03:01.910 --> 03:03.910
The First Prince deserves it.

33
03:04.310 --> 03:05.910
Whether His Majesty learned of it

34
03:05.910 --> 03:07.000
sooner or later—

35
03:07.520 --> 03:09.180
what difference does it make?

36
03:10.680 --> 03:11.520
Go on.

37
03:13.240 --> 03:13.960
If this case

38
03:13.960 --> 03:15.630
was submitted by the Divine Constable Bureau,

39
03:15.630 --> 03:16.430
I think

40
03:16.470 --> 03:18.680
His Majesty, to balance the power in the court,

41
03:18.680 --> 03:21.240
would definitely protect the First Prince once.

42
03:21.240 --> 03:22.030
So,

43
03:22.150 --> 03:23.750
it's better to leak this news

44
03:23.870 --> 03:25.000
to the Crown Prince

45
03:25.079 --> 03:27.870
and let him take the lead.

46
03:28.800 --> 03:29.840
This way,

47
03:30.150 --> 03:32.280
not only is the First Prince punished,

48
03:32.870 --> 03:33.560
but it also clears the relationship

49
03:33.560 --> 03:35.490
with the Divine Constable Bureau.

50
03:36.910 --> 03:37.910
Chief Xuanyuan.,

51
03:38.400 --> 03:40.960
actually, I am just

52
03:41.680 --> 03:43.560
solving problems for you.

53
03:59.680 --> 04:00.680
Chief Xuanyuan,

54
04:02.150 --> 04:03.410
there is one more thing

55
04:03.680 --> 04:05.360
I still can't figure out.

56
04:06.910 --> 04:08.520
Before His Majesty issued an edict

57
04:08.520 --> 04:10.120
to punish the First Prince,

58
04:11.310 --> 04:12.660
the government salt matter

59
04:12.660 --> 04:14.680
had already spread among the people.

60
04:14.680 --> 04:15.750
I once sent people

61
04:15.870 --> 04:18.310
to secretly investigate the source of the news,

62
04:18.310 --> 04:19.970
but could never track it down.

63
04:21.510 --> 04:22.630
You mean

64
04:23.120 --> 04:24.270
besides you,

65
04:24.640 --> 04:26.530
someone else leaked the news?

66
04:29.310 --> 04:30.120
I think

67
04:31.600 --> 04:33.159
this person must hope

68
04:33.680 --> 04:36.750
to cause chaos in the Great Shi's court.

69
04:37.560 --> 04:38.800
Isn't that

70
04:39.680 --> 04:40.830
the same as you?

71
04:48.310 --> 04:49.240
I wouldn't dare.

72
04:50.800 --> 04:53.750
Think about it. The government salt matter

73
04:54.310 --> 04:56.040
is known to only a few people.

74
04:56.680 --> 04:57.560
I guess

75
04:58.000 --> 04:59.830
this person either has been

76
05:00.070 --> 05:01.670
following us from the start,

77
05:01.680 --> 05:02.480
or

78
05:03.310 --> 05:05.510
he is from the Divine Constable Bureau.

79
05:07.190 --> 05:08.160
I see.

80
05:10.770 --> 05:13.500
If there's anything else, just say it all at once.

81
05:16.560 --> 05:19.020
There is indeed one more thing I want to ask of you.

82
05:19.020 --> 05:20.960
[Winter's Haven]

83
05:23.310 --> 05:25.310
How did it go? What did the Chief say?

84
05:25.680 --> 05:27.010
After much persuasion,

85
05:27.070 --> 05:27.870
she finally agreed

86
05:27.870 --> 05:29.310
to let Xia Jiuying stay.

87
05:29.560 --> 05:30.360
However,

88
05:30.510 --> 05:32.870
the Chief has her own arrangements.

89
05:33.310 --> 05:34.120
That's good.

90
05:34.120 --> 05:34.720
At least she has

91
05:34.720 --> 05:35.950
a place to stay.

92
05:38.120 --> 05:39.510
Our trip to Mingling this time

93
05:39.510 --> 05:41.640
can be considered an unexpected gain.

94
05:41.680 --> 05:42.510
The Dark Night Organization

95
05:42.510 --> 05:43.950
wanted to kill Jiuying to silence her

96
05:43.950 --> 05:44.680
because they were afraid she would

97
05:44.680 --> 05:46.159
reveal the location of the cave,

98
05:46.159 --> 05:47.070
thereby exposing

99
05:47.070 --> 05:49.070
their mutation of the demon wolves.

100
05:49.190 --> 05:50.560
Having demon-men isn't enough.

101
05:50.560 --> 05:52.690
They want to cultivate more monsters.

102
05:53.000 --> 05:54.310
I'm worried that next,

103
05:54.560 --> 05:56.159
Liluo will make a major move.

104
05:56.600 --> 05:57.390
Right.

105
05:57.870 --> 06:00.240
Our division must be

106
06:00.720 --> 06:02.680
on high alert these next few days.

107
06:13.600 --> 06:15.460
The details of the Mingling case,

108
06:15.510 --> 06:16.770
from beginning to end,

109
06:17.120 --> 06:19.510
are known only to the Divine Constable Bureau.

110
06:19.510 --> 06:20.600
I didn't expect

111
06:21.720 --> 06:23.630
you to know it so clearly.

112
06:25.800 --> 06:27.160
Everything I do

113
06:27.160 --> 06:28.760
is for the Holy Lord.

114
06:29.390 --> 06:32.050
The Great Shi Dynasty must be thrown into chaos.

115
06:33.680 --> 06:35.050
The more chaotic it is,

116
06:35.310 --> 06:38.070
the more advantageous it is for us.

117
06:40.750 --> 06:42.080
In this Tianhuang City,

118
06:42.730 --> 06:44.860
when it comes to being well-informed,

119
06:44.870 --> 06:46.820
no one can compare to Li Qingyang.

120
06:46.870 --> 06:48.770
If you spread news privately,

121
06:49.560 --> 06:50.560
aren't you afraid

122
06:51.120 --> 06:53.120
he will suspect you?

123
06:57.460 --> 06:59.950
What do I have to be afraid of?

124
07:01.160 --> 07:02.360
His life

125
07:04.450 --> 07:07.680
is in my hands.

126
07:13.970 --> 07:16.110
[Tianshu Pavilion]

127
07:43.510 --> 07:45.360
Has the God of Lies, Qipi,

128
07:46.159 --> 07:48.040
also turned to dust?

129
07:54.510 --> 07:55.600
Chief.

130
07:58.390 --> 07:59.830
I called you here

131
07:59.870 --> 08:02.040
to let you meet someone.

132
08:12.510 --> 08:13.310
Who?

133
08:25.430 --> 08:26.240
Jiuying?

134
08:28.390 --> 08:30.310
I initially wanted to arrange a place for her,

135
08:30.310 --> 08:31.560
but after spending a few days with her,

136
08:31.560 --> 08:34.020
I found she is agile and quick-witted.

137
08:34.049 --> 08:35.590
She's good material for a constable.

138
08:35.590 --> 08:37.960
I'll keep her in the division and teach her myself,

139
08:37.960 --> 08:39.600
starting as a trainee constable.

140
08:39.600 --> 08:40.780
I have to say,

141
08:40.960 --> 08:43.840
Jiuying looks quite good in this outfit.

142
08:43.960 --> 08:45.730
It's great that she can stay.

143
08:45.960 --> 08:47.290
Quick, thank the Chief.

144
08:52.320 --> 08:53.790
Thank you, Chief.

145
09:01.400 --> 09:03.590
Oh no. It's the Tianshu Pavilion.

146
09:25.850 --> 09:27.100
A Liluo man?

147
09:28.710 --> 09:30.200
To think you can come and go freely

148
09:30.200 --> 09:31.410
in the Tianshu Pavilion.

149
09:31.410 --> 09:32.000
[Tianshu Pavilion]

150
09:32.000 --> 09:34.360
Who exactly are you?

151
09:34.750 --> 09:36.910
Unless he's from the Divine Constable Bureau.

152
09:36.910 --> 09:38.320
Just like Lou Tianming,

153
09:38.550 --> 09:39.270
he's a mole planted

154
09:39.270 --> 09:41.140
by Liluo in the Divine Constable Bureau.

155
09:41.140 --> 09:42.340
I don't care who he is.

156
09:42.790 --> 09:43.670
Let's capture him first!

157
09:43.670 --> 09:44.660
Stop!

158
09:47.200 --> 09:48.200
Let him go.

159
09:48.440 --> 09:50.360
Chief, he's from Liluo.

160
09:50.720 --> 09:51.750
He is extremely audacious.

161
09:51.750 --> 09:53.200
He trespassed into the Tianshu Pavilion.

162
09:53.200 --> 09:54.910
I don't need to explain to you.

163
09:55.120 --> 09:56.510
What happened at the Tianshu Pavilion today

164
09:56.510 --> 09:58.320
must not be revealed to anyone.

165
09:58.320 --> 10:00.720
Otherwise, you will be severely punished.

166
10:06.120 --> 10:07.030
Did you hear me?

167
10:08.510 --> 10:09.320
-Yes. -Yes.

168
10:26.770 --> 10:27.760
What's going on?

169
10:34.790 --> 10:37.270
If word gets out

170
10:37.960 --> 10:41.000
that I came to see you tonight...

171
10:44.060 --> 10:45.900
Just do your job.

172
10:47.010 --> 10:48.330
No one in the Divine Constable Bureau

173
10:48.330 --> 10:49.730
will stand in your way.

174
10:51.540 --> 10:53.800
Now that the First Prince has lost power,

175
10:53.960 --> 10:56.640
there's an undercurrent at court.

176
10:56.790 --> 10:58.510
It is a time of change.

177
10:59.960 --> 11:02.960
Chief, don't miss this chance.

178
11:28.360 --> 11:29.680
Such lightness skill

179
11:29.790 --> 11:31.610
is truly incredible.

180
11:31.960 --> 11:33.080
Don't worry.

181
11:33.320 --> 11:34.790
I know who that kid is.

182
11:35.000 --> 11:36.320
I'll handle him.

183
11:36.380 --> 11:38.200
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

184
11:45.000 --> 11:45.790
Master.

185
11:46.030 --> 11:47.630
Ask the girls to work a little harder

186
11:47.630 --> 11:48.960
and find someone for me.

187
11:49.030 --> 11:50.200
Please tell me, Master.

188
11:50.200 --> 11:51.480
He's a middle-aged man

189
11:51.480 --> 11:52.360
with rather delicate features.

190
11:52.360 --> 11:54.250
He's not actually that old,

191
11:54.600 --> 11:56.870
just unkempt,

192
11:56.960 --> 11:58.490
so he looks older than he is.

193
11:59.200 --> 12:01.260
His martial arts are not weak either.

194
12:01.910 --> 12:03.360
I want to know all his movements

195
12:03.360 --> 12:04.550
after he entered Tianhuang City.

196
12:04.550 --> 12:05.360
Yes.

197
12:06.390 --> 12:08.110
The girls have checked all the martial artists

198
12:08.110 --> 12:09.150
going in and out of

199
12:09.150 --> 12:10.320
Tianhuang City.

200
12:10.790 --> 12:12.920
There really aren't many experts

201
12:12.960 --> 12:14.000
who match your description:

202
12:14.000 --> 12:15.080
a square face, small eyes,

203
12:15.080 --> 12:16.320
looks old but is actually

204
12:16.320 --> 12:17.240
middle-aged.

205
12:17.360 --> 12:19.630
Although most of them have no fixed residence,

206
12:19.630 --> 12:21.400
they all have names in jianghu.

207
12:21.630 --> 12:23.260
Only one among them stands out—

208
12:23.260 --> 12:25.550
his identity is mysterious, and his background unknown.

209
12:25.550 --> 12:26.510
But he has been living in the same place

210
12:26.510 --> 12:28.000
for several days in a row.

211
12:28.670 --> 12:29.480
Where?

212
12:30.000 --> 12:31.000
Lanyue Pavilion.

213
12:41.130 --> 12:42.270
[Lanyue Pavilion]

214
12:42.270 --> 12:43.080
Everyone,

215
12:43.440 --> 12:45.630
former Minister of Works, Tang Yiming,

216
12:45.630 --> 12:46.790
Master Tang,

217
12:47.000 --> 12:50.860
was the best craftsman in the world before he entered the government.

218
12:50.960 --> 12:52.200
He was an expert

219
12:52.200 --> 12:54.930
in mechanics and landscaping.

220
12:55.120 --> 12:57.520
He was known as the reincarnation of Lu Ban.

221
12:59.550 --> 13:00.670
After resigning,

222
13:00.790 --> 13:03.600
he spent 5 years drawing blueprints.

223
13:04.150 --> 13:05.960
He and his son, Tang Wei,

224
13:06.120 --> 13:07.090
spent six years

225
13:07.090 --> 13:07.960
[Lanyue Pavilion]

226
13:07.960 --> 13:10.870
building the number one pavilion in the Great Shi.

227
13:11.550 --> 13:12.200
Counting the days,

228
13:12.200 --> 13:12.750
[Lanyue Pavilion]

229
13:12.750 --> 13:15.280
Lanyue Pavilion has been built for ten years.

230
13:15.440 --> 13:19.030
From the top, you can see all the scenery of Tianhuang City.

231
13:19.600 --> 13:20.680
It's said that

232
13:20.960 --> 13:23.630
you can even see the imperial palace clearly.

233
13:25.320 --> 13:27.150
Before the construction of Lanyue Pavilion,

234
13:27.150 --> 13:29.320
an imperial censor once submitted a memorial,

235
13:29.320 --> 13:31.750
arguing that a hundred-foot tower towering above the palace

236
13:31.750 --> 13:33.630
was a great act of disrespect.

237
13:33.630 --> 13:33.960
Yes.

238
13:33.960 --> 13:34.510
Indeed.

239
13:34.510 --> 13:36.080
How could it be taller than the palace?

240
13:36.080 --> 13:37.690
But our wise His Majesty

241
13:37.690 --> 13:38.150
[Lanyue Pavilion]

242
13:38.150 --> 13:39.720
didn't care.

243
13:40.120 --> 13:42.720
He even wrote 8 big characters.

244
13:43.120 --> 13:44.270
Which 8 characters?

245
13:44.440 --> 13:45.480
Yes, tell us.

246
13:45.960 --> 13:47.960
Harmony between ruler and subject—

247
13:48.960 --> 13:51.080
what's wrong with that?

248
13:51.320 --> 13:53.120
What... What does this mean?

249
13:53.200 --> 13:54.540
-And then? -And then?

250
13:54.840 --> 13:55.840
-Yes, what happened next? -And then?

251
13:55.840 --> 13:56.840
Keep going.

252
13:56.840 --> 13:57.440
Tell us.

253
13:57.440 --> 13:59.360
If you want to know what happened next,

254
13:59.360 --> 14:02.750
listen to the next chapter.

255
14:12.640 --> 14:13.030
[Lanyue Pavilion]

256
14:13.030 --> 14:13.840
Zhenzhu.

257
14:14.870 --> 14:15.670
Li Si?

258
14:16.150 --> 14:17.240
Why are you here?

259
14:17.630 --> 14:19.000
Every early autumn,

260
14:19.000 --> 14:19.910
naturally,

261
14:20.130 --> 14:20.200
[Lanyue Pavilion]

262
14:20.200 --> 14:22.150
the lantern festival at Lanyue Pavilion

263
14:22.150 --> 14:23.200
is the liveliest.

264
14:23.720 --> 14:25.000
How could I miss it?

265
14:26.750 --> 14:27.670
Let me help you.

266
14:43.030 --> 14:50.210
[Lanyue Pavilion]

267
15:16.540 --> 15:19.670
[Lanyue Pavilion]

268
15:19.670 --> 15:20.480
Just now,

269
15:20.840 --> 15:22.200
what did you wish for?

270
15:23.750 --> 15:25.510
I wished for the Great Shi Dynasty to have

271
15:25.510 --> 15:28.240
peace in the world and prosperity for the people.

272
15:34.440 --> 15:35.390
A good wish.

273
15:41.510 --> 15:42.510
Since we're here,

274
15:42.510 --> 15:43.240
why don't

275
15:44.790 --> 15:46.550
we stroll around Lanyue Pavilion?

276
15:46.550 --> 15:47.410
How about that?

277
15:47.550 --> 15:48.090
Let's go.

278
15:48.110 --> 15:48.920
Let's go.

279
15:48.920 --> 15:58.130
[Lanyue Pavilion]

280
16:30.320 --> 16:31.510
This Lanyue Pavilion

281
16:31.510 --> 16:33.600
is a business from 10 years ago.

282
16:34.440 --> 16:35.510
It's too formal

283
16:36.150 --> 16:37.240
and lacks novelty,

284
16:37.750 --> 16:38.510
so its foot traffic

285
16:38.510 --> 16:41.310
is naturally less than Star-Gathering Pavilion.

286
16:42.320 --> 16:44.600
I wonder if you've heard

287
16:44.720 --> 16:45.790
a strange tale.

288
16:47.510 --> 16:49.510
The boss of Lanyue Pavilion is Tang Wei,

289
16:49.510 --> 16:50.750
and he has quite a background.

290
16:50.750 --> 16:51.480
His father

291
16:51.480 --> 16:53.150
was the former Minister of Works.

292
16:53.150 --> 16:55.120
He resigned years ago to seek the Dao.

293
16:55.120 --> 16:56.510
It's said he was enlightened

294
16:56.510 --> 16:57.960
and ascended to become an immortal.

295
16:57.960 --> 16:59.750
An old servant saw with his own eyes

296
16:59.750 --> 17:00.840
a mechanical wooden bird

297
17:00.840 --> 17:01.840
circling a rainbow

298
17:01.840 --> 17:04.240
and carrying Master Tang's body to the sky.

299
17:04.750 --> 17:06.750
This alarmed His Majesty

300
17:06.829 --> 17:08.160
and the Chief.

301
17:08.400 --> 17:11.240
Unfortunately, the Divine Constable Bureau searched for days

302
17:11.240 --> 17:13.300
but found neither Master Tang's body

303
17:13.310 --> 17:14.310
nor

304
17:14.400 --> 17:16.000
the wreckage of the wooden bird.

305
17:16.000 --> 17:17.460
A mechanical wooden bird?

306
17:18.640 --> 17:20.030
Could Master Tang

307
17:20.750 --> 17:22.480
be the reincarnation of Lu Ban?

308
17:23.160 --> 17:24.109
I have never believed

309
17:24.109 --> 17:25.400
in ghosts and gods.

310
17:27.400 --> 17:28.720
Young Master Qingyang,

311
17:28.720 --> 17:29.920
you are right.

312
17:30.110 --> 17:32.880
My master indeed attained immortality.

313
17:34.160 --> 17:35.030
You are?

314
17:35.310 --> 17:35.750
[Qin Dayuan, Butler of Tang Manor]

315
17:35.750 --> 17:38.280
The butler of the Tang residence— Qin Dayuan.

316
17:41.550 --> 17:42.640
You recognize me?

317
17:42.750 --> 17:44.160
My young master ordered me to be here

318
17:44.160 --> 17:45.590
to wait for you.

319
17:51.030 --> 17:51.830
Please.

320
18:08.960 --> 18:09.920
Butler Qin,

321
18:10.350 --> 18:12.070
how did Young Master Tang know

322
18:13.160 --> 18:14.830
I would come to visit?

323
18:15.030 --> 18:16.270
My young master calculated

324
18:16.270 --> 18:18.790
that you would come on his birthday.

325
18:19.110 --> 18:20.640
Over the years, the young master

326
18:20.640 --> 18:22.590
has never miscalculated.

327
18:25.920 --> 18:27.880
I don't believe in ghosts or gods,

328
18:28.400 --> 18:30.930
nor do I believe in divination or prophecies.

329
18:31.200 --> 18:32.110
Young Master Qingyang relies on being

330
18:32.110 --> 18:33.350
[Shuyue Residence]

331
18:33.350 --> 18:35.510
the Crown Prince's favorite

332
18:36.000 --> 18:38.200
to slander gods and immortals here.

333
18:38.480 --> 18:39.610
You should know that

334
18:39.720 --> 18:42.310
when I served the Crown Prince,

335
18:42.510 --> 18:44.480
he wasn't even born yet.

336
18:46.000 --> 18:48.750
Such a mortal with no connection to immortals,

337
18:48.750 --> 18:50.000
why bother with him?

338
18:50.000 --> 18:52.480
It's better to drink elixirs in the forest

339
18:52.510 --> 18:54.240
and retreat to the mountains.

340
18:55.160 --> 18:55.580
No, no, no.

341
18:55.580 --> 18:57.160
[Shuyue Residence]

342
18:57.160 --> 18:58.510
Retreating to the deep mountains

343
18:58.510 --> 19:00.840
cannot isolate me from the secular world.

344
19:01.110 --> 19:03.270
Why not go and return?

345
19:06.240 --> 19:07.590
Who are these two?

346
19:08.030 --> 19:08.920
These are

347
19:09.550 --> 19:11.400
some of the young master's friends.

348
19:11.400 --> 19:13.330
You don't need to pay them any mind.

349
19:14.440 --> 19:15.500
It doesn't matter.

350
19:16.810 --> 19:17.160
[Shuyue Residence]

351
19:17.160 --> 19:18.550
The young master has been waiting on the seventh floor

352
19:18.550 --> 19:19.920
for a long time.

353
19:19.920 --> 19:20.850
Please, Master.

354
19:24.310 --> 19:25.160
Thank you.

355
19:29.850 --> 19:33.150
[Sixth Floor]

356
20:16.440 --> 20:19.240
You must be Tang Wei, Boss Tang?

357
20:23.160 --> 20:24.790
Today is your birthday.

358
20:25.550 --> 20:26.920
I came in a hurry

359
20:27.030 --> 20:28.490
and didn't prepare a gift.

360
20:29.750 --> 20:32.080
The day of arrival is the day of departure.

361
20:32.350 --> 20:34.310
What is there to rejoice in arriving,

362
20:34.310 --> 20:36.310
and what is there to grieve in departing?

363
20:36.310 --> 20:37.840
With neither grief nor joy,

364
20:38.750 --> 20:40.200
why prepare a gift?

365
20:43.400 --> 20:45.060
My words were inappropriate;

366
20:45.160 --> 20:46.240
please forgive me.

367
20:47.830 --> 20:50.030
I lack spiritual insight.

368
20:50.440 --> 20:51.240
However,

369
20:52.160 --> 20:53.560
from what you're saying,

370
20:54.400 --> 20:55.640
your birthday

371
20:57.160 --> 20:59.560
is about to become your death anniversary.

372
21:03.160 --> 21:04.160
A few days ago,

373
21:04.750 --> 21:07.750
my father appeared in a dream from the heavenly realm,

374
21:07.750 --> 21:08.640
saying,

375
21:08.920 --> 21:11.240
the day of arrival is the day of departure.

376
21:11.240 --> 21:13.440
He prophesied that on my birthday,

377
21:14.110 --> 21:16.170
I would pass on to the heavenly realm.

378
21:17.440 --> 21:18.310
Boss Tang,

379
21:20.240 --> 21:21.700
midnight is approaching.

380
21:23.350 --> 21:24.770
But looking at you,

381
21:26.310 --> 21:27.880
aren't you perfectly fine?

382
21:35.890 --> 21:37.790
[Tang Wei]

383
21:40.240 --> 21:42.960
Beautiful moonlight, beautiful night.

384
21:45.480 --> 21:48.730
How about enjoying it with me, Young Master Qingyang?

385
21:49.830 --> 21:51.550
If it's truly as you say,

386
21:51.790 --> 21:53.320
and your days are numbered,

387
21:53.700 --> 21:56.060
you should spend them with your family.

388
21:57.030 --> 21:58.960
I am neither family nor friend.

389
21:59.510 --> 22:02.030
It seems quite inconvenient.

390
22:04.880 --> 22:06.410
Young Master Qingyang and I

391
22:07.070 --> 22:09.310
are both people who cannot see our past clearly.

392
22:09.310 --> 22:10.480
That's why I say

393
22:12.830 --> 22:14.440
we are fated to meet.

394
22:15.880 --> 22:18.480
What do you mean by not seeing the past clearly?

395
22:21.030 --> 22:22.830
Since it cannot be seen clearly,

396
22:23.480 --> 22:25.280
how can it be explained clearly?

397
22:28.880 --> 22:29.920
Back to the point.

398
22:30.310 --> 22:31.490
Butler Qin said

399
22:31.680 --> 22:33.640
you've been waiting for me here for a long time.

400
22:33.640 --> 22:34.480
I wonder,

401
22:34.830 --> 22:36.760
what advice do you have, Boss Tang?

402
22:37.030 --> 22:39.550
I have something to give you.

403
22:55.510 --> 22:57.440
I can't accept a reward without merit.

404
22:57.440 --> 22:58.750
What if I say this item

405
22:59.640 --> 23:03.030
is related to Liluo?

406
23:23.880 --> 23:25.240
Did you see Boss Tang?

407
23:26.830 --> 23:27.640
What did you talk about

408
23:27.640 --> 23:28.410
for so long?

409
23:28.410 --> 23:31.830
[Lanyue Pavilion]

410
23:31.830 --> 23:35.790
This Lanyue Pavilion is connected to Liluo.

411
23:36.790 --> 23:38.000
Why do you say that?

412
23:45.030 --> 23:46.830
This was given to me by Boss Tang.

413
23:47.480 --> 23:48.270
He said...

414
23:48.880 --> 23:50.560
This item is related to Liluo.

415
23:59.240 --> 24:01.640
I still don't know

416
24:02.270 --> 24:03.640
what this really is,

417
24:03.830 --> 24:04.640
and

418
24:07.200 --> 24:08.600
what Boss Tang's purpose

419
24:08.920 --> 24:10.640
in giving it to me

420
24:11.030 --> 24:12.160
really is.

421
24:12.270 --> 24:12.760
[Lanyue Pavilion]

422
24:13.160 --> 24:14.230
[Lanyue Pavilion]

423
24:28.710 --> 24:28.830
[Lanyue Pavilion]

424
24:28.830 --> 24:31.720
Something happened!

425
24:31.830 --> 24:34.000
Someone fell from above!

426
24:36.350 --> 24:37.160
Young Master!

427
24:38.590 --> 24:39.400
Young Master!

428
24:39.510 --> 24:40.480
Boss Tang.

429
24:42.340 --> 24:44.710
Young Master!

430
25:01.650 --> 25:04.510
[Lanyue Pavilion Ascension Case]

431
25:04.540 --> 25:08.070
[Lanyue Pavilion]

432
25:08.070 --> 25:09.530
Keep an eye on everything.

433
25:17.750 --> 25:18.550
How is it?

434
25:21.270 --> 25:22.930
Skull, sternum, and leg bones

435
25:23.030 --> 25:24.410
have multiple fractures.

436
25:24.410 --> 25:26.000
The cause of death is falling from a height.

437
25:26.000 --> 25:28.110
I just don't know if he fell on his own

438
25:28.200 --> 25:30.960
or was pushed.

439
25:32.830 --> 25:34.230
[Lanyue Pavilion]

440
25:34.720 --> 25:35.880
As for the footprints in the room,

441
25:35.880 --> 25:37.240
besides Tang Wei, Qin Dayuan,

442
25:37.240 --> 25:39.240
and Li Si's,

443
25:39.480 --> 25:40.680
there's a fourth one.

444
25:48.510 --> 25:50.110
What are you thinking about?

445
25:50.200 --> 25:51.270
There are three people

446
25:51.270 --> 25:53.270
who need to be watched immediately.

447
25:53.270 --> 25:55.160
Qin Dayuan and

448
25:57.240 --> 25:59.020
the two guests in the sixth-floor private room.

449
25:59.020 --> 25:59.590
[Lanyue Pavilion]

450
26:03.510 --> 26:05.510
People down there, step back!

451
26:06.070 --> 26:06.720
Step back, everyone.

452
26:06.720 --> 26:07.240
Step back.

453
26:07.240 --> 26:08.440
Everyone, step back.

454
26:08.480 --> 26:09.270
Step back.

455
26:09.270 --> 26:09.850
Okay.

456
26:10.070 --> 26:11.030
Step back.

457
26:20.310 --> 26:21.710
The position is a bit far.

458
26:22.070 --> 26:23.470
The position is a bit far!

459
26:23.590 --> 26:24.400
Look.

460
26:24.680 --> 26:26.350
If he was pushed down,

461
26:26.400 --> 26:27.600
the landing position

462
26:27.830 --> 26:28.830
would be further

463
26:28.830 --> 26:30.030
than if he jumped himself.

464
26:30.030 --> 26:31.720
This doesn't count as me pushing him.

465
26:31.720 --> 26:32.880
The premise of it being further

466
26:32.880 --> 26:34.480
is that the victim resisted desperately,

467
26:34.480 --> 26:35.310
and the killer had to use

468
26:35.310 --> 26:36.440
a lot of force.

469
26:38.400 --> 26:39.830
Okay, wait here.

470
26:40.830 --> 26:41.680
Give it to me.

471
26:46.480 --> 26:47.310
Make way!

472
26:56.880 --> 26:58.540
Just now it landed on its face,

473
26:58.640 --> 26:59.840
this time on its back.

474
27:01.070 --> 27:01.830
Yes.

475
27:07.110 --> 27:08.910
No matter how determined to die,

476
27:09.240 --> 27:10.030
people who commit suicide

477
27:10.030 --> 27:11.480
always look at the ground,

478
27:11.480 --> 27:13.160
usually face down.

479
27:13.310 --> 27:15.160
But if they are pushed,

480
27:15.310 --> 27:17.550
the landing part is uncertain.

481
27:19.270 --> 27:20.160
And also,

482
27:20.680 --> 27:23.350
suicide victims usually have a peaceful face.

483
27:23.880 --> 27:25.790
But if they struggled desperately

484
27:25.790 --> 27:27.310
and were pushed,

485
27:28.070 --> 27:30.960
their face would be grim.

486
27:32.400 --> 27:33.240
Li Si said

487
27:33.400 --> 27:34.240
Tang Wei had already predicted

488
27:34.240 --> 27:35.570
that he would die today.

489
27:35.680 --> 27:36.480
So,

490
27:36.680 --> 27:39.010
he might not have struggled desperately.

491
27:48.360 --> 27:49.420
Zhenzhu, careful!

492
27:56.680 --> 27:58.200
There's a problem with this railing.

493
27:58.200 --> 27:59.590
It can't bear any weight at all.

494
27:59.590 --> 28:00.680
In that case,

495
28:00.680 --> 28:01.310
if Boss Tang

496
28:01.310 --> 28:02.920
didn't know there was a problem with the railing

497
28:02.920 --> 28:03.920
and leaned against it

498
28:03.920 --> 28:05.380
to enjoy the moon as usual,

499
28:05.480 --> 28:07.720
then he would fall down

500
28:07.790 --> 28:09.390
without anyone pushing him.

501
28:09.480 --> 28:11.590
No wonder we couldn't tell from the body

502
28:11.590 --> 28:13.240
whether he was pushed

503
28:13.240 --> 28:14.960
or fell down himself.

504
28:15.880 --> 28:17.030
Do you think this railing

505
28:17.030 --> 28:18.590
is in disrepair

506
28:18.590 --> 28:19.400
or...

507
28:19.440 --> 28:20.240
Man-made.

508
28:21.830 --> 28:22.720
This tenon

509
28:22.750 --> 28:23.440
was obviously

510
28:23.440 --> 28:24.920
unscrewed on purpose,

511
28:25.070 --> 28:26.200
not due to

512
28:26.200 --> 28:27.240
weathering.

513
28:27.400 --> 28:29.720
Lanyue Pavilion has regular maintenance.

514
28:29.720 --> 28:31.480
If such a big mistake was found,

515
28:31.480 --> 28:32.810
it wouldn't be ignored.

516
28:34.030 --> 28:35.830
The person in charge of maintenance

517
28:35.830 --> 28:37.200
seems to be Qin Dayuan.

518
28:37.640 --> 28:39.500
This person can be investigated.

519
28:39.920 --> 28:40.790
My lords,

520
28:42.880 --> 28:44.310
Constable Qingyang has already taken Qin Dayuan

521
28:44.310 --> 28:45.640
to the Divine Constable Bureau.

522
28:45.640 --> 28:46.480
And before the incident,

523
28:46.480 --> 28:47.590
the two guests on the sixth floor,

524
28:47.590 --> 28:48.640
Lord Huang Gang

525
28:48.640 --> 28:49.680
and Lord Jiang Zeshui,

526
28:49.680 --> 28:50.720
were also taken back

527
28:50.720 --> 28:51.680
by Constable Qingyang.

528
28:51.680 --> 28:53.160
Li Si acts fast.

529
28:53.480 --> 28:55.270
Is there anyone else on the sixth floor

530
28:55.270 --> 28:57.200
who can be taken back for interrogation?

531
28:57.200 --> 28:58.070
No, Mr. Yan.

532
28:58.070 --> 28:58.510
We both

533
28:58.510 --> 28:59.680
have confirmed it.

534
28:59.680 --> 29:00.640
The sixth floor tonight

535
29:00.640 --> 29:02.170
was booked by the two lords.

536
29:02.310 --> 29:03.570
No one else has come up.

537
29:04.310 --> 29:05.310
To go up and down Lanyue Pavilion,

538
29:05.310 --> 29:06.720
you must pass through the stairs.

539
29:06.720 --> 29:08.070
To get to the seventh floor,

540
29:08.070 --> 29:09.670
you must go up floor by floor.

541
29:09.750 --> 29:10.550
So,

542
29:10.920 --> 29:12.500
if there's a suspect,

543
29:12.590 --> 29:14.920
it's most likely the two of them.

544
29:16.720 --> 29:19.030
Young Master Qingyang interrogated me last night.

545
29:19.030 --> 29:21.430
Lanyue Pavilion has regular maintenance,

546
29:21.680 --> 29:23.510
which I personally supervise.

547
29:24.070 --> 29:25.000
So it's impossible

548
29:25.000 --> 29:26.790
for the railing to be unsteady.

549
29:29.440 --> 29:31.070
What if you have a problem?

550
29:38.830 --> 29:40.240
Back then, I was

551
29:40.240 --> 29:42.020
just a low-level servant in the Tang Mansion,

552
29:42.020 --> 29:43.180
bullied by others.

553
29:43.270 --> 29:44.510
Thanks to the Master and Young Master

554
29:44.510 --> 29:45.880
for protecting me many times,

555
29:45.880 --> 29:47.410
and promoting me to butler.

556
29:47.510 --> 29:49.000
I must repay this favor.

557
29:50.030 --> 29:51.640
My death is not a pity,

558
29:52.030 --> 29:54.880
but I beg you to find the murderer

559
29:55.590 --> 29:57.120
to avenge the Young Master.

560
30:05.920 --> 30:07.880
Steward Qin, get up first.

561
30:15.240 --> 30:16.230
His pulse shows

562
30:16.270 --> 30:17.920
palpitations caused by anger,

563
30:17.920 --> 30:18.960
not panic.

564
30:19.200 --> 30:20.240
He's not lying.

565
30:26.000 --> 30:27.590
Since Li Si interrogated him,

566
30:27.590 --> 30:28.720
he's probably fine.

567
30:29.240 --> 30:31.640
It all depends on the two on the sixth floor.

568
30:56.680 --> 30:58.920
The Crown Prince had a severe illness in his childhood.

569
30:58.920 --> 31:00.070
His body was too weak to absorb tonics.

570
31:00.070 --> 31:01.350
It was our master

571
31:01.480 --> 31:02.640
who, relying on a bowl

572
31:02.640 --> 31:02.730
of porridge that nourished qi and blood,

573
31:02.730 --> 31:04.270
[Former Head of the Imperial Kitchen, Huang Gang]

574
31:04.270 --> 31:06.130
helped the Crown Prince survive.

575
31:06.310 --> 31:07.830
Come to think of it, our master

576
31:07.830 --> 31:09.590
has served two emperors

577
31:09.590 --> 31:10.790
and one Crown Prince.

578
31:10.790 --> 31:12.240
Even if Xuanyuan Shan came,

579
31:12.240 --> 31:14.200
he wouldn't dare to interrogate our master.

580
31:14.200 --> 31:16.590
Who are you two to question him?

581
31:21.200 --> 31:24.200
Our Lord Jiang has managed water systems countless times.

582
31:24.200 --> 31:26.310
He is known as Yu the Great reborn.

583
31:26.720 --> 31:26.930
When the current His Majesty was still a prince,

584
31:26.930 --> 31:29.240
[Former River Supervisor, Jiang Zeshui]

585
31:29.240 --> 31:30.270
it was with the help of

586
31:30.270 --> 31:31.880
our master

587
31:32.030 --> 31:34.480
that the dikes on both sides of the Yellow River were built,

588
31:34.480 --> 31:36.030
saving countless lives.

589
31:36.920 --> 31:39.400
Have you lost your minds

590
31:39.480 --> 31:40.680
to dare question him?

591
31:41.030 --> 31:42.030
Why don't you call that

592
31:42.030 --> 31:43.200
Xuanyuan Shan out

593
31:43.200 --> 31:44.240
to give our master

594
31:44.240 --> 31:45.960
a face-to-face apology?

595
31:48.750 --> 31:49.400
Get out!

596
31:49.400 --> 31:49.960
Master!

597
31:49.960 --> 31:50.590
Take him away!

598
31:50.590 --> 31:52.040
-Master. -Master.

599
31:54.200 --> 31:56.030
The Divine Constable Bureau answers directly to imperial power.

600
31:56.030 --> 31:57.630
No matter what his status is.

601
31:58.110 --> 31:59.240
Those two lackeys

602
31:59.240 --> 32:01.030
have already been kicked out by me.

603
32:01.030 --> 32:03.030
If you two lords don't say anything,

604
32:03.310 --> 32:05.030
I can completely use torture.

605
32:05.480 --> 32:07.080
Whatever the consequences,

606
32:07.240 --> 32:08.590
I will bear them alone.

607
32:11.880 --> 32:12.640
Are you hard of hearing?

608
32:12.640 --> 32:14.030
Can't you hear me?

609
32:14.030 --> 32:14.960
Brother Sanhuo.

610
32:19.480 --> 32:20.510
Brother Sanhuo.

611
32:20.720 --> 32:22.480
Your upright and unyielding character

612
32:22.480 --> 32:24.000
truly makes me admire you.

613
32:24.400 --> 32:26.640
But even if you aren't afraid,

614
32:26.790 --> 32:27.590
look at them.

615
32:27.590 --> 32:29.240
With the age of these two elders,

616
32:29.240 --> 32:30.880
let alone severe torture,

617
32:31.030 --> 32:33.110
even staying in jail for a few days,

618
32:33.270 --> 32:34.200
I'm afraid

619
32:34.680 --> 32:36.610
they might pass away at any moment.

620
32:41.000 --> 32:42.210
From what you mean,

621
32:42.510 --> 32:44.550
not only can we not touch them,

622
32:44.830 --> 32:46.630
but we also have to worship them.

623
32:48.510 --> 32:49.680
That's not necessary either—

624
32:49.680 --> 32:51.680
no need to make it that troublesome.

625
32:54.590 --> 32:56.520
Release Lord Jiang and Lord Huang!

626
32:56.680 --> 32:57.440
Why arrest

627
32:57.440 --> 32:58.900
Lord Jiang and Lord Huang?

628
32:59.400 --> 33:01.000
What evidence do you have?

629
33:02.240 --> 33:03.350
I think

630
33:04.030 --> 33:06.030
these two elders in the Divine Constable Bureau

631
33:06.030 --> 33:07.550
won't stay for long.

632
33:08.440 --> 33:08.620
Release Lord Jiang!

633
33:08.620 --> 33:09.640
[Divine Constable Bureau]

634
33:09.640 --> 33:10.400
Why arrest

635
33:10.400 --> 33:11.860
Lord Jiang and Lord Huang?

636
33:12.270 --> 33:13.360
What evidence do you have?

637
33:13.360 --> 33:15.200
[Divine Constable Bureau]

638
33:15.200 --> 33:16.230
Release them now!

639
33:17.310 --> 33:18.440
I'll count to three.

640
33:18.790 --> 33:20.050
If you don't disperse,

641
33:20.830 --> 33:22.200
the cells in the back courtyard of the Divine Constable Bureau

642
33:22.200 --> 33:23.330
are waiting for you.

643
33:24.070 --> 33:26.000
Meng, who are you trying to scare?

644
33:26.030 --> 33:26.880
That's right!

645
33:26.880 --> 33:27.400
Right!

646
33:27.400 --> 33:27.920
One.

647
33:28.920 --> 33:30.110
Don't be afraid, everyone.

648
33:30.110 --> 33:31.480
Lord Jiang and Lord Huang

649
33:31.480 --> 33:33.030
have always treated us well!

650
33:33.030 --> 33:34.680
-Even if we risk our lives today... -That's right!

651
33:34.680 --> 33:35.310
Two!

652
33:35.310 --> 33:36.150
we have to save them!

653
33:36.150 --> 33:37.640
Release Lord Jiang and Lord Huang!

654
33:37.640 --> 33:38.480
Mr. Meng!

655
33:38.680 --> 33:39.500
Mr. Meng, please stop!

656
33:39.500 --> 33:40.850
[Divine Constable Bureau]

657
33:46.110 --> 33:47.960
Constable Ghost, stop playing.

658
33:47.980 --> 33:49.440
Don't hurt Lord Huang

659
33:49.440 --> 33:50.830
and Lord Jiang.

660
33:51.320 --> 33:53.020
Are you two eunuchs

661
33:53.240 --> 33:56.000
representing His Majesty and the Eastern Palace

662
33:56.030 --> 33:57.400
to plead for mercy?

663
33:58.400 --> 33:59.310
Lady Xuanyuan.

664
33:59.640 --> 34:01.270
If His Majesty issues an edict,

665
34:01.270 --> 34:03.590
I will naturally release them.

666
34:03.590 --> 34:04.310
Well...

667
34:07.880 --> 34:08.880
Lady Xuanyuan,

668
34:09.070 --> 34:11.030
how could His Majesty issue an explicit decree

669
34:11.030 --> 34:12.630
to interfere with the Divine Constable Bureau's handling of a case?

670
34:12.630 --> 34:14.510
His Majesty is wise.

671
34:15.110 --> 34:15.920
You...

672
34:18.110 --> 34:19.070
You naturally understand

673
34:19.070 --> 34:19.880
His Majesty's intention.

674
34:19.880 --> 34:21.440
Why pretend to be confused?

675
34:21.510 --> 34:23.190
The two elders are old,

676
34:23.920 --> 34:26.050
and it's not suitable to torture them.

677
34:26.320 --> 34:29.199
Our Divine Constable Bureau will treat them well.

678
34:35.190 --> 34:37.000
Lady Xuanyuan means

679
34:37.480 --> 34:40.480
the Divine Constable Bureau refuses to release them?

680
34:41.030 --> 34:42.190
If I

681
34:42.480 --> 34:44.670
release them because of their past status,

682
34:44.670 --> 34:47.600
our Divine Constable Bureau will lose its prestige,

683
34:48.230 --> 34:49.710
but His Majesty

684
34:50.230 --> 34:51.440
will lose face too.

685
34:51.630 --> 34:52.920
That's why

686
34:52.920 --> 34:54.710
he didn't issue an explicit decree.

687
34:54.710 --> 34:57.230
You two should know this.

688
34:57.280 --> 34:58.070
I know.

689
34:58.920 --> 35:01.230
Never mind, let's go back first.

690
35:04.670 --> 35:05.480
Take care.

691
35:13.230 --> 35:14.710
Dismissed. It's nothing.

692
35:21.440 --> 35:22.190
How's the interrogation

693
35:22.190 --> 35:23.030
[Pillar of the Realm]

694
35:23.030 --> 35:24.360
with Li Si and Yan Cheng?

695
35:24.670 --> 35:25.800
Strangely,

696
35:26.070 --> 35:27.400
the two elders neither defend themselves

697
35:27.400 --> 35:28.360
nor panic.

698
35:28.630 --> 35:30.150
It seems they are

699
35:30.150 --> 35:31.480
happy about something.

700
35:32.630 --> 35:35.070
And according to the guy in Lanyue Pavilion,

701
35:35.070 --> 35:37.280
they booked the private room on the 6th floor last night.

702
35:37.280 --> 35:38.840
They neither sought beauties

703
35:38.840 --> 35:40.230
nor invited friends.

704
35:40.630 --> 35:41.670
Instead,

705
35:42.090 --> 35:43.820
they were plotting something.

706
35:44.480 --> 35:45.280
So,

707
35:45.480 --> 35:47.030
we have to make them talk.

708
35:48.190 --> 35:49.790
Since we can't torture them,

709
35:50.030 --> 35:51.070
how should we interrogate them?

710
35:51.070 --> 35:52.320
Please instruct.

711
35:58.710 --> 35:59.510
Zhenzhu,

712
36:00.070 --> 36:02.000
you interrogate them.

713
36:33.480 --> 36:36.230
Trapped in the mortal world for 80 years,

714
36:36.880 --> 36:39.800
my heart is like a Taiyi immortal in the water.

715
36:40.190 --> 36:42.840
Going out with a smile, free of obstacles,

716
36:43.230 --> 36:46.630
clouds in the West Lake, moon in the sky.

717
36:47.320 --> 36:49.230
Pigs and sheep sit on the kang,

718
36:49.400 --> 36:51.590
relatives are boiled in the pot.

719
36:52.400 --> 36:54.460
Daughters eat their mothers' flesh,

720
36:54.880 --> 36:57.150
sons beat their fathers' skin drums.

721
36:57.880 --> 36:59.920
Relatives come to congratulate,

722
37:00.920 --> 37:03.880
I think it's really bitter.

723
37:12.480 --> 37:13.630
Uncles,

724
37:14.110 --> 37:15.510
I am Bai Zhenzhu.

725
37:16.000 --> 37:17.960
When I was young, I met you

726
37:18.000 --> 37:19.320
at my house.

727
37:19.440 --> 37:22.590
So you are the apple of the elder's eye.

728
37:22.800 --> 37:25.430
You are indeed extraordinary.

729
37:26.070 --> 37:28.590
Since we are on the same path,

730
37:28.620 --> 37:30.710
we will tell you everything we know.

731
37:32.190 --> 37:33.590
I have long heard

732
37:33.630 --> 37:36.150
that Mr. Tang never miscalculates,

733
37:36.670 --> 37:38.550
and I deeply admire him.

734
37:39.000 --> 37:40.070
This time, I also want

735
37:40.070 --> 37:41.510
to ask you two.

736
37:42.230 --> 37:44.320
Did Mr. Tang really predict

737
37:44.800 --> 37:46.800
his own death long ago?

738
37:49.030 --> 37:51.670
Before my nephew passed away,

739
37:52.630 --> 37:55.110
he once told us

740
37:55.480 --> 37:57.800
that there would be imprisonment,

741
37:57.800 --> 38:00.360
but it wouldn't be a big deal.

742
38:05.370 --> 38:07.150
[To Lord Huang, Your Nephew Tang Wei]

743
38:12.440 --> 38:15.590
Approaching the end, suddenly happy and sad.

744
38:16.000 --> 38:19.030
Gloomy in prison, both safe and dangerous.

745
38:19.670 --> 38:20.630
Nephew Tang Wei.

746
38:20.800 --> 38:22.920
Autumn of the 37th year of Hongyun.

747
38:26.060 --> 38:26.750
[With my final return drawing near, I am at once joyful and sorrowful. The prison is dark and dreary, where safety and danger walk hand in hand.]

748
38:26.880 --> 38:28.030
So

749
38:28.030 --> 38:30.280
Mr. Tang had already foreseen

750
38:30.280 --> 38:31.320
that you two uncles

751
38:31.320 --> 38:34.050
would be brought to the Divine Constable Bureau.

752
38:39.400 --> 38:40.630
Can Tang Wei

753
38:41.630 --> 38:44.360
really foresee the future?

754
38:44.450 --> 38:47.760
[Lanyue Pavilion]

755
38:53.030 --> 38:54.360
Thank you, Steward Qin.

756
38:58.030 --> 38:59.490
According to your orders,

757
38:59.630 --> 39:02.160
the private rooms of Lord Huang and Lord Jiang

758
39:03.190 --> 39:04.250
remain untouched.

759
39:07.670 --> 39:08.480
According to the previous

760
39:08.480 --> 39:10.440
statement of the staff in the building,

761
39:10.440 --> 39:12.510
there have always been only

762
39:12.510 --> 39:15.660
two guests, Huang Gang and Jiang Zeshui, on this sixth floor.

763
39:15.660 --> 39:18.000
But why are there four sets of bowls and chopsticks?

764
39:18.000 --> 39:20.590
These are the affairs of the lords.

765
39:20.880 --> 39:22.400
Servants like us

766
39:23.880 --> 39:24.840
wouldn't know.

767
39:32.470 --> 39:33.400
Steward Qin,

768
39:35.030 --> 39:36.560
I want to ask you a question.

769
39:37.480 --> 39:39.320
There was a middle-aged man

770
39:39.480 --> 39:41.630
with excellent skills and a square face with narrow eyes.

771
39:41.630 --> 39:43.440
This person stayed in this Lanyue Pavilion

772
39:43.440 --> 39:45.030
for several days.

773
39:45.320 --> 39:46.850
Do you have any impression?

774
39:52.400 --> 39:53.190
In this Lanyue Pavilion,

775
39:53.190 --> 39:55.790
with so many people coming and going every day,

776
39:57.670 --> 39:59.230
I really can't remember.

777
40:10.890 --> 40:14.000
What exactly does this thing

778
40:14.000 --> 40:15.200
have to do with Liluo?

779
40:21.670 --> 40:24.260
[Lanyue Pavilion]

780
40:35.460 --> 40:38.970
[Lanyue Pavilion]

781
40:49.440 --> 40:50.640
These footprints...

782
40:51.960 --> 40:52.760
No.

783
40:52.940 --> 40:55.130
[Lanyue Pavilion]

784
40:59.510 --> 41:00.280
There are so many carpets

785
41:00.280 --> 41:01.680
laid in Lanyue Pavilion.

786
41:01.800 --> 41:04.070
Walking all the way from the first floor to the seventh floor,

787
41:04.070 --> 41:05.030
how could it be possible to leave

788
41:05.030 --> 41:06.560
such a complete footprint?

789
41:06.760 --> 41:07.550
Right.

790
41:08.150 --> 41:08.880
No matter how dirty the shoes are,

791
41:08.880 --> 41:10.740
they would have been wiped clean.

792
41:12.230 --> 41:14.960
That footprint was left on purpose.

793
41:26.110 --> 41:27.840
To leave a footprint like this,

794
41:27.880 --> 41:29.280
you have to be like me

795
41:29.280 --> 41:30.630
and step down hard.

796
41:32.000 --> 41:32.920
If

797
41:33.590 --> 41:35.920
the killer wanted to sneak up from behind,

798
41:36.030 --> 41:37.690
how could they walk like this?

799
41:42.840 --> 41:43.710
Therefore,

800
41:44.280 --> 41:45.920
Tang Wei committed suicide.

801
41:46.630 --> 41:49.320
He left this footprint

802
41:49.840 --> 41:52.630
to create the illusion

803
41:52.670 --> 41:54.590
that someone was behind him.

804
41:55.530 --> 41:57.440
But Tang Wei was perfectly fine.

805
41:57.440 --> 41:59.040
Why would he end his own life?

806
41:59.880 --> 42:00.760
My lords.

807
42:02.070 --> 42:02.880
We found this suicide note

808
42:02.880 --> 42:03.610
left by Tang Wei

809
42:03.610 --> 42:03.710
[Suicide Note]

810
42:03.710 --> 42:04.360
in the account books

811
42:04.360 --> 42:05.690
at the Lanyue Pavilion.

812
42:06.000 --> 42:07.130
When did you find it?

813
42:07.630 --> 42:09.030
About half an hour ago.

814
42:09.030 --> 42:09.840
1 PM.

815
42:10.880 --> 42:13.320
We just found out Tang Wei committed suicide,

816
42:13.320 --> 42:14.510
and you guys found his suicide note

817
42:14.510 --> 42:15.440
so quickly?

818
42:20.110 --> 42:21.360
Writing this letter,

819
42:21.630 --> 42:23.320
I am still a living person.

820
42:23.800 --> 42:25.260
When you read this letter,

821
42:25.480 --> 42:27.880
I will already be a ghost in the underworld.

822
42:37.110 --> 42:38.710
Tang Wei wrote it elegantly.

823
42:39.480 --> 42:40.880
But between the lines,

824
42:41.280 --> 42:43.010
it reveals something bizarre.

825
42:43.710 --> 42:44.550
Bizarre?

826
42:47.070 --> 42:48.630
Tang Wei's parents are dead.

827
42:48.630 --> 42:50.090
He has no wife or children.

828
42:50.630 --> 42:51.880
He became a Taoist in recent years,

829
42:51.880 --> 42:53.880
and doesn't have any close friends.

830
42:55.030 --> 42:56.400
Then who is this

831
42:57.030 --> 42:58.510
suicide note written to?

832
43:00.880 --> 43:01.710
Moreover,

833
43:03.220 --> 43:03.630
[Tang Wei's Note]

834
43:03.630 --> 43:07.150
who does 'you' refer to?

835
43:15.550 --> 43:16.360
How is it?

836
43:19.000 --> 43:19.880
Judging from the handwriting,

837
43:19.880 --> 43:20.880
Mr. Tang's writing

838
43:20.880 --> 43:22.440
is agile and fast.

839
43:22.440 --> 43:24.370
The strokes are thin but vigorous,

840
43:24.710 --> 43:26.630
thin but not losing their flesh.

841
43:26.630 --> 43:28.110
His large characters especially show

842
43:28.110 --> 43:29.400
their graceful charm.

843
43:29.400 --> 43:30.360
Come on.

844
43:31.440 --> 43:32.190
Just tell me,

845
43:32.190 --> 43:33.440
is it his or not?

846
43:34.230 --> 43:36.830
The suicide note is indeed written by Mr. Tang.

847
43:39.960 --> 43:40.760
Please.

848
43:46.000 --> 43:47.000
It seems that

849
43:47.280 --> 43:48.710
Boss Tang really might have

850
43:48.710 --> 43:49.880
killed himself.

851
43:50.630 --> 43:51.630
No wonder he could predict

852
43:51.630 --> 43:52.840
that Lord Huang and Lord Jiang

853
43:52.840 --> 43:54.300
would face imprisonment.

854
43:55.070 --> 43:56.000
He staged it himself,

855
43:56.000 --> 43:58.000
jumping down from Lanyue Pavilion.

856
43:58.000 --> 43:59.460
He definitely figured out

857
43:59.480 --> 44:00.480
that Huang and Jiang

858
44:00.480 --> 44:02.400
would be taken away by our Divine Constable Bureau.

859
44:02.400 --> 44:03.190
It seems

860
44:03.400 --> 44:04.630
we need to inform

861
44:04.630 --> 44:06.000
Qin Dayuan about this.
